    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present 93 Carrigwood, a spacious extended 4 bedroom family home located within the highly sought-after Carrigwood development. The property measures circa 119 sq.m and offers a huge scope to extend further subject to relevant planning. The property has a perfect position overlooking a large green space.\nThe bright and spacious accommodation includes an entrance hallway, living room, extended open plan kitchen/ dining room while upstairs there are 3 generous sized bedrooms and a main family bathroom. The property benefits from an extension to the rear and side (currently being used as a 4th bedroom) and has huge scope to convert further. The property also benefits from an outside office space perfect for working remotely or utilising for hobbies. Outside to the rear you will find a rear garden with a sunny aspect which is the ideal setting for entertaining guests or enjoying a family BBQ. To the front of the property there is a large tarmac driveway and lawn providing off street parking for multiple cars. \n\nCarrigwood is a highly regarded family-friendly neighbourhood, ideally located close to an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools, as well as local shopping facilities including SuperValu and Lidl. Residents can enjoy nearby Dodder Valley Park and the recently upgraded Dodder Greenway, with its café and electric bike rental facilities. The area is also exceptionally well connected, with regular bus services to Dublin City Centre and convenient access to the M50 motorway.\n\nFeatures to include:\n\nStorm Porch\nGuest WC\nUtility Room\nFrench door leading to private rear garden \nUpgraded staircase and Internal doors \nDecorative Panelling and Coving \nElectric Shower \nFamily friendly Cul de sac location.\n\n\nViewing is highly recommended!"
      },
